<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Zygo raised to strong buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Zygo raised to strong buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown &amp; Sons said it raised its rating on Zygo Corp to a strong buy from buy on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- The stock moved higher in late morning trading, rising 2-5/8 to 45-1/2.</p>
</text>
